{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/760503-what-kind-of-pack-would-have-this-totem","id":760503,"title":"What kind of Pack would have this totem?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-07T22:09:57-08:00","id":760503,"title":"What kind of Pack would have this totem?","content":"What kind of pack would have a spider spirit as a totem?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-07T23:39:05-08:00","id":760534,"title":"","content":"Many, many spiders are cannibalistic. You could have a Hunter in Darkness pack with a spider spirit as totem who specializes in hunting Azlu, to the benefit of the kind of insight that such a totem would provide in hunting their favored prey.<br /> <br /> Alternatively, the spider is a renowned natural architect. Urban pack of Bone Shadows and Iron Masters who wish to control the resonance of their territory with Feng Shui applied architecture.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-09T03:27:22-08:00","id":761344,"title":"","content":"Um... lessee, just looking it up on wikipedia... spiders have been seen as creatures of fate (something Exalted took up on), based on the image of weaving. In both some parts of Africa and North America spiders are trickster figures...<br /> <br /> And there is always the symbology of control and watching.<br /> <br /> So, any pack who'd pick up on a spirit with those kinds of symbology.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","name":"Seidmadr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}